{
    "name": "01 — Greenhouse expenses (Telegram)",
    "flow": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {
                "hook": null,
                "maxResults": 1
            },
            "mapper": {},
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0,
                    "name": "Telegram update"
                },
                "notes": "Create the hook, copy its URL, then point the bot at it once: https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/setWebhook?url=<THIS_URL>. Telegram posts the whole update object here, so 1.message.text, 1.message.chat.id, 1.message.photo[] and 1.message.caption are all available downstream. See docs/02-setup.md."
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "module": "util:SetVariable2",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {},
            "filter": {
                "name": "Owner only",
                "conditions": [
                    [
                        {
                            "a": "{{1.message.chat.id}}",
                            "o": "text:equal",
                            "b": "<<OWNER_CHAT_ID>>"
                        }
                    ]
                ]
            },
            "mapper": {
                "name": "msg",
                "scope": "roundtrip",
                "value": "{{ifempty(1.message.text; 1.message.caption)}}"
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 300,
                    "y": 0,
                    "name": "Gate + normalise text"
                },
                "notes": "THE SECURITY GATE. Anything from another chat stops here and is never written. Replace <<OWNER_CHAT_ID>>: message the bot once, then open https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates and read message.chat.id. A photo carries its text in caption, not text — ifempty handles both."
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 3,
            "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {},
            "mapper": {},
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 600,
                    "y": 0,
                    "name": "Command or expense?"
                }
            },
            "routes": [
                {
                    "flow": [
                        {
                            "id": 4,
                            "module": "google-sheets:filterRows",
                            "version": 2,
                            "parameters": {
                                "__IMTCONN__": null
                            },
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "Commands only",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{2.msg}}",
                                            "o": "text:startwith",
                                            "b": "/"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "mode": "select",
                                "spreadsheetId": "<<LEDGER_SPREADSHEET_ID>>",
                                "sheetId": "expenses",
                                "includesHeaders": true,
                                "filter": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "P",
                                            "b": "void",
                                            "o": "ne"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ],
                                "sortOrder": "desc",
                                "limit": 500
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 900,
                                    "y": -150,
                                    "name": "Read ledger"
                                },
                                "notes": "Reads every live row (column P 'void' marks a cancelled one). 500 rows is far above anything this project will produce; raise it if the ledger ever grows past that."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": 5,
                            "module": "telegram:SendReplyMessage",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {
                                "__IMTCONN__": null
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "chatId": "{{1.message.chat.id}}",
                                "parseMode": "HTML",
                                "text": "<b>ბიუჯეტი / Budget</b>\n\nბიუჯეტი: <b>625,000 ₾</b>\nდახარჯული: <b>{{formatNumber(sum(map(4.array; \"F\")); 2; \".\"; \",\")}} ₾</b>\nდარჩენილი: <b>{{formatNumber(625000 - sum(map(4.array; \"F\")); 2; \".\"; \",\")}} ₾</b>\nჩანაწერი: {{length(4.array)}}\n\nბოლო: {{get(4.array; \"1.A\")}} — {{get(4.array; \"1.B\")}} — {{get(4.array; \"1.F\")}} ₾"
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 1200,
                                    "y": -150,
                                    "name": "Reply: where we are"
                                },
                                "notes": "Column F is amount_gel. The 625000 budget is written here rather than read from a cell so the bot still answers if the sheet is unreachable; if the facility ever changes, change it here and in finance/build_model.py."
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "flow": [
                        {
                            "id": 6,
                            "module": "anthropic-claude:createAMessage",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {
                                "__IMTCONN__": null
                            },
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "Not a command",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{2.msg}}",
                                            "o": "text:notstartwith",
                                            "b": "/"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
                                "max_tokens": 1024,
                                "temperature": 0,
                                "system": "<<PASTE prompts/00-conventions.md THEN prompts/01-expense-agent.md>>",
                                "messages": [
                                    {
                                        "role": "user",
                                        "content": "Today is {{formatDate(now; \"YYYY-MM-DD\"; \"Asia/Tbilisi\")}}.\n\nOwner message:\n{{2.msg}}"
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 900,
                                    "y": 150,
                                    "name": "Claude: parse the expense"
                                },
                                "notes": "temperature 0 — this is extraction, not writing. Today's date is passed in because the model has no clock. To read receipt photos, add the image as a second content block of type image; see docs/01-architecture.md."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": 7,
                            "module": "json:ParseJSON",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {
                                "type": null
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "json": "{{6.content[].text}}"
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 1200,
                                    "y": 150,
                                    "name": "Parse JSON"
                                },
                                "notes": "If this module errors the model broke the output contract. Attach an error handler that replies to the owner with the raw text rather than failing silently."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": 8,
                            "module": "google-sheets:addRow",
                            "version": 2,
                            "parameters": {
                                "__IMTCONN__": null
                            },
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "Only a clean log_expense",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{7.action}}",
                                            "o": "text:equal",
                                            "b": "log_expense"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "mode": "select",
                                "spreadsheetId": "<<LEDGER_SPREADSHEET_ID>>",
                                "sheetId": "expenses",
                                "includesHeaders": true,
                                "insertDataOption": "INSERT_ROWS",
                                "valueInputOption": "USER_ENTERED",
                                "values": {
                                    "0": "{{7.parameters.date}}",
                                    "1": "{{7.parameters.description}}",
                                    "2": "{{7.parameters.counterparty}}",
                                    "3": "{{7.parameters.category}}",
                                    "4": "{{7.parameters.treatment}}",
                                    "5": "{{7.parameters.amount_gel}}",
                                    "6": "{{7.parameters.currency}}",
                                    "7": "{{7.parameters.amount_original}}",
                                    "8": "{{7.parameters.fx_rate}}",
                                    "9": "{{7.parameters.payment_method}}",
                                    "10": "{{7.parameters.contract}}",
                                    "11": "telegram",
                                    "12": "{{1.message.from.username}}",
                                    "13": "{{formatDate(now; \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm\"; \"Asia/Tbilisi\")}}",
                                    "14": "{{7.parameters.confidence}}",
                                    "15": "",
                                    "16": "{{7.log_message}}"
                                }
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 1500,
                                    "y": 150,
                                    "name": "Append to ledger"
                                },
                                "notes": "Column order must match sheets/expenses-ledger-template.csv exactly. Column P (index 15) is the void flag — always written empty; only /undo fills it."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": 9,
                            "module": "telegram:SendReplyMessage",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {
                                "__IMTCONN__": null
                            },
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "Logged",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{7.action}}",
                                            "o": "text:equal",
                                            "b": "log_expense"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "chatId": "{{1.message.chat.id}}",
                                "parseMode": "HTML",
                                "text": "✅ <b>ჩაიწერა / Logged</b>\n\n{{7.parameters.description}}\n<b>{{formatNumber(7.parameters.amount_gel; 2; \".\"; \",\")}} ₾</b> · {{7.parameters.category}} · {{7.parameters.treatment}}\n{{if(7.parameters.counterparty = \"\"; \"\"; 7.parameters.counterparty)}}\n{{7.parameters.date}}\n\n{{if(7.parameters.confidence < 0.8; \"⚠️ ვერ ვარ დარწმუნებული კატეგორიაში — შეასწორეთ ცხრილში თუ საჭიროა.\"; \"\")}}\n\n/balance — სად ვართ"
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 1800,
                                    "y": 150,
                                    "name": "Reply: logged"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": 10,
                            "module": "telegram:SendReplyMessage",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {
                                "__IMTCONN__": null
                            },
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "Needs a question",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{7.action}}",
                                            "o": "text:equal",
                                            "b": "ask_clarification"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "chatId": "{{1.message.chat.id}}",
                                "parseMode": "HTML",
                                "text": "❓ {{7.parameters.question_ka}}\n\n<i>{{7.parameters.question_en}}</i>"
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 1800,
                                    "y": 300,
                                    "name": "Reply: ask"
                                },
                                "notes": "Nothing is written on this path. The owner answers in the next message, which arrives as a fresh update — the agent is stateless, so the answer must repeat the amount."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": 11,
                            "module": "telegram:SendReplyMessage",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {
                                "__IMTCONN__": null
                            },
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "Large or uncertain",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{7.action}}",
                                            "o": "text:equal",
                                            "b": "confirm_first"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "chatId": "{{1.message.chat.id}}",
                                "parseMode": "HTML",
                                "text": "⚠️ <b>დასადასტურებელია / Confirm</b>\n\n{{7.parameters.description}}\n<b>{{formatNumber(7.parameters.amount_gel; 2; \".\"; \",\")}} ₾</b> · {{7.parameters.category}}\n{{7.parameters.counterparty}}\n{{7.parameters.date}}\n\nდასადასტურებლად უპასუხეთ: <code>დიახ</code>",
                                "replyMarkup": "{\"inline_keyboard\":[[{\"text\":\"✅ დიახ / Yes\",\"callback_data\":\"confirm\"},{\"text\":\"❌ არა / No\",\"callback_data\":\"cancel\"}]]}"
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 1800,
                                    "y": 450,
                                    "name": "Reply: confirm first"
                                },
                                "notes": "THE MONEY GATE. Anything at or above 10,000 GEL, or parsed with low confidence, stops here until the owner taps. Wiring the callback back into this scenario is step 7 of docs/02-setup.md; until that is done the owner re-sends the message with the word 'დიახ' and it goes down the log_expense path."
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "metadata": {
        "instant": true,
        "version": 1,
        "scenario": {
            "roundtrips": 1,
            "maxErrors": 3,
            "autoCommit": true,
            "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
            "sequential": true,
            "confidential": false,
            "dlq": false,
            "freshVariables": false
        },
        "designer": {
            "orientation": "horizontal"
        },
        "zone": "eu1.make.com",
        "notes": [
            "Replace three placeholders before the first run: <<OWNER_CHAT_ID>>, <<LEDGER_SPREADSHEET_ID>>, and the system prompt in module 6.",
            "Module identifiers verified against the Make API on 17 Sep 2026: anthropic-claude:createAMessage (NOT createMessage), google-sheets:addRow/filterRows v2, telegram:SendReplyMessage v1.",
            "The gateway webhook MUST NOT have API key authentication. Telegram sends plain POSTs with no custom headers, so an authenticated hook rejects every update. Make cannot remove the authentication once set - create a fresh unauthenticated hook instead.",
            "No WebhookRespond module: it is unsupported alongside sequential processing, and Make returns 200 by itself. sequential stays on so two quick messages cannot race into the same sheet row."
        ]
    }
}